    "message": "Keep calls for the report when runtime decisions share a Run allowance\n\nRuntime decisions, the post-run report, results questions and the\nintervention compiler all draw on the same Run usage account. A 30-agent\n7-day live run (cap 30) spent every call on runtime decisions and its Opus\nreview fell back.\n\nRuntime calls now stop with ANALYSIS_RESERVED_CALLS (3) calls left on the\naccount: the report plus two questions. The ledger checks this inside the\nreservation transaction (keep_calls_free, capped at max_calls - 1), and the\nrouter reports the refusal as runtime_call_share_exhausted so it shows in\nfallback summaries and warnings. No persisted format changes.\n\nVerified offline (610 tests) and live: the same 7-day run now ends with a\nvalidated review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
